<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mellow Pearl Japan | 高級真珠ジュエリー</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --main-grey: #f4f4f4;
            --text-dark: #333333;
            --accent-gold: #c5a059;
            --bg-charcoal: #2d2d2d;
        }

        body {
            font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN", "Hiragino Sans", Meiryo, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: var(--main-grey);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        header {
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #fff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        }

        .banner-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .banner-container img {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .brand-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.2rem;
            color: var(--bg-charcoal);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .brand-subtitle {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .content-section {
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            text-align: left;
        }

        h2 {
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-gold);
            padding-left: 15px;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .intro-text {
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .pearl-types {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin: 30px 0;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .pearl-tag {
            background: var(--bg-charcoal);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 5px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 60px;
            padding: 40px 0;
            background-color: var(--bg-charcoal);
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            background-color: var(--accent-gold);
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 2px;
            transition: opacity 0.3s;
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <div class="banner-container">
        <img src="banner.jpg" alt="Mellow Pearl Japan Banner">
    </div>
</header>

<main>
    <h1 class="brand-title">MELLOW PEARL JAPAN</h1>
    <p class="brand-subtitle">「自分らしさ」を、最高級の輝きで彩る。</p>

    <div class="content-section">
        <p class="intro-text">
            ご覧いただきありがとうございます。大阪・西区のアトリエで、天然真珠の美しさを引き出すジュエリーを制作している <strong>Mellow Pearl Japan</strong> です。
        </p>

        <h2>Our Pearls</h2>
        <div class="pearl-types">
            <span class="pearl-tag">白蝶真珠 (澳白)</span>
            <span class="pearl-tag">アコヤ真珠</span>
            <span class="pearl-tag">タヒチ真珠</span>
            <span class="pearl-tag">淡水真珠</span>
        </div>

        <h2>Brand Concept</h2>
        <p>甘すぎない「Mode Style」をベースに、身に着けるたびに「今日も頑張ろう！」と思えるポジティブで情热的なデザインをお届けします。</p>

        <h2>Location</h2>
        <p>大阪府大阪市中央区南久宝寺町4-5-17 アップウェル船場 201室</p>
        
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <a href="#" class="cta-button">Visit minne Store (Coming Soon)</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Mellow Pearl Japan / 羽天株式会社. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    <p>Wear it last, take it off first.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
